WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:05.509
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and there’s
a whole lot of Walking Dead stuff going on

00:00:05.509 --> 00:00:08.200
right now so I’ll try to cover it all in
this video.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:15.330
First AMC just officially ordered a pilot
for the Spinoff TV Series.

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:18.110
So I’ll do a big update on what’s going
on with that.

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:21.320
I know a lot of you want to know what it’s
about and some are wondering why they’re

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.760
even making a spinoff.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:28.640
And Norman Reedus posted a potentially spoilery
Daryl image to facebook yesterday.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.570
So after spinoff talk I’ll explain what
that was all about.

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:33.930
Hint, it might not be a spoiler.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:37.640
Especially if he posted it to his mega facebook
page.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.059
So don’t freak out yet.

00:00:39.059 --> 00:00:42.809
If you’re just finding me for the first
time I’m doing weekly walking dead videos

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:46.570
for season 5 and just like last year I’ll
also be doing a weekly giveaway.

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:49.350
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:50.519
Now, important stuff first.

00:00:50.519 --> 00:00:53.870
WTF is the spinoff all about and why haven’t
they been talking about it more?

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:58.229
The Spinoff is going to be a completely different
group of characters not in or around the places

00:00:58.229 --> 00:00:59.889
featured on the main tv show right now.

00:00:59.889 --> 00:01:02.109
So no Georgia, no Washington, no Terminus.

00:01:02.109 --> 00:01:03.920
Somewhere else presumably in America.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:09.479
It’s possible they could choose to shoot
it in Vancouver to save money on production,

00:01:09.479 --> 00:01:13.460
but for all intents and purposes the story
will still be based in the United States.

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:18.530
The idea of a Walking Dead show taking place
in Europe or China would be cool, but those

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:24.340
types of shows usually happen when Studios
sell the rights in other countries.

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:28.109
For instance, Breaking Bad sold the rights
to the show in Mexico, so there’s a hispanic

00:01:28.109 --> 00:01:31.020
version of Breaking Bad with it’s own set
of characters.

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:33.850
The story is pretty much the same but the
show is called Metastasis and instead of being

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:35.429
Walter White, the main character is Walter
Blanco.

00:01:35.429 --> 00:01:39.130
It’s Breaking Bad produced in spanish instead
of being subtitled or dubbed.

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:48.689
So if you want to see what’s happening in
south america right now 

00:01:48.689 --> 00:01:54.109
in the walking dead universe.

00:01:54.109 --> 00:01:56.399
That would probably be how it would happen.

00:01:56.399 --> 00:01:59.399
Right now the spinoff has just been greenlit
for a pilot.

00:01:59.399 --> 00:02:03.619
Meaning AMC will pay 4 or 5 million dollars
for them to produce a one or two hour pilot

00:02:03.619 --> 00:02:04.619
episode.

00:02:04.619 --> 00:02:10.140
AMC will then either decide to order it to
series or they’ll pass on it and try for

00:02:10.140 --> 00:02:13.590
another spinoff in a couple years.

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:23.570
There have been a lot of rumors about when
the story would take place.

00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:26.940
The biggest theory is that it would cover
the time leading up to the virus outbreak.

00:02:26.940 --> 00:02:30.230
I don’t think that’s true but it’s one
of the better theories.

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:34.230
It’s more likely that Robert Kirkman, who’s
working on the pilot himself, will try to

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:37.250
capitalize on the aspects of the Walking Dead
Universe that people love the most.

00:02:37.250 --> 00:02:42.620
And Walking Dead is all about people trying
to survive in the fallout.

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:49.510
Making a show about an impending viral outbreak
would be more like a procedural.

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:53.930
It would be more like World War Z, with everyone
dealing with the outbreak.

00:02:53.930 --> 00:02:56.350
When I think it’s so much more interesting
to see the aftermath.

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:59.460
If you look at the Walking Dead Telltale game,
it’s got an amazing narrative with a completely

00:02:59.460 --> 00:03:02.030
different group of characters taking place
concurrently with events in the comic book.

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:03.230
I think the spinoff will do a similar thing.

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:07.410
I think the success of the telltale game gives
Robert Kirkman a lot of confidence that a

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:09.370
completely different story set during the
same time period is still something people

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:10.370
want.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.470
Here’s a big question for you guys, let
me know in the comments.

00:03:12.470 --> 00:03:14.930
If it had to take place in the United States.

00:03:14.930 --> 00:03:19.320
Where would you want the spinoff to take place,
in a big city or in another rural area like

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:21.810
Macon Georgia where Terminus is supposed to
be?

00:03:21.810 --> 00:03:23.380
Or do you totally not care where it is?

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:25.430
There’s this really weird thing I’ve noticed
with the fandom.

00:03:25.430 --> 00:03:37.370
Right now Walking Dead is the most popular
show on cable, by a wide margin.

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:42.960
It’s more popular than Game of Thrones because
Game of Thrones is on a premium cable channel.

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:43.960
So fewer people subscribe and have access
to it.

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:44.960
But even though Walking Dead is so popular
and makes crazy dump trucks of money.

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:45.960
I see it get a lot of hate from some of the
core audience.

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:48.390
Like people in general love it, but there’s
a large group of people that also really hate

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:49.390
it.

00:03:49.390 --> 00:03:53.080
Let me know where you fall on the spectrum.

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:56.420
Personally I’ve already bought my ticket
and I’ll ride the train all the way to Hogwarts

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.650
or Terminus depending on where you think the
show will end.

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:02.860
I’m of the opinion that when it does end
it will be more ambiguous, like a few of the

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:05.970
characters will just trudge on into the distance
and try to keep surviving.

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:08.090
I don’t think they’ll ever cure the virus.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:09.820
That’s not what the show is about.

00:04:09.820 --> 00:04:12.110
It’s about surviving to the last breath.

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:13.350
Surviving with machine guns.

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:18.480
But eventually you have to run out of bullets,
this isn’t a Rambo movie where you have

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:19.820
unlimited ammo.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:23.440
Speaking of unlimited ammo, Daryl and his
crossbow were spotted on set.

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:27.600
Norman Reedus posted a picture that teases
something from the comics but really I think

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:29.040
it’s a misdirect.

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:33.100
I don’t think he’d ever do something so
stupid as to spoil a big reveal.

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:39.760
I’m going to talk more about Daryl in general,
but for a couple of these images I’ll say

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:40.790
potential spoiler warning.

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:44.590
I’ll leave this hashtag up for the duration.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:46.910
Everybody ready...okay, here we go.

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:50.260
So Norman Reedus posted a couple images with
greg nicotero on set.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:57.960
He has a bloodied hand in one of them and
in another picture, there’s a hand on the

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:00.420
ground with the caption “Divorced”.

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:06.650
Notice the wedding ring on his hand.

00:05:06.650 --> 00:05:13.890
The hand in the first picture, this one.

00:05:13.890 --> 00:05:16.070
Is a different hand than the one on the ground
here.

00:05:16.070 --> 00:05:17.721
So clearly he’s messing with us.

00:05:17.721 --> 00:05:18.721
The whole thing had people nuts because it’s
a twist on another big character in the comics

00:05:18.721 --> 00:05:19.721
getting their hand chopped off.

00:05:19.721 --> 00:05:20.721
Just to answer the biggest question.

00:05:20.721 --> 00:05:23.400
No I do not think Daryl will get his hand
chopped off, I don’t remember him even wearing

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:24.400
a wedding ring.

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:27.560
And they’re not going to maim one of the
main characters unless they intend to kill

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:33.270
them off.

00:05:33.270 --> 00:05:44.370
Hershel’s leg made sense because that character
isn’t the crazy action based fighting person

00:05:44.370 --> 00:05:46.170
Rick or Daryl or Abraham are.

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:50.950
Season 5 is all about action.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:54.250
So yes, someone will get their hand chopped
off, but I don’t think it will be Rick or

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:55.250
Daryl.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:58.820
What I do think will happen is some random
person will get a hand chopped off and it

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:02.680
will be the show’s way of winking at the
comic books without having to go through the

00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:07.910
burden of writing around a missing hand for
the next 3 or 4 seasons.

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:08.910
Spoilers over.

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:14.070
There was a shot in the trailer of Carl with
an eye patch, which mirrors something from

00:06:14.070 --> 00:06:19.700
the comics, but I don’t think any of the
bigger lead characters will suffer crazy maiming

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:20.700
injuries.

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:23.790
There have been lots of rumors about one of
them dying, but at this point, the show has

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:35.200
diverged so much from the comics, I try to
not make huge comic predictions.

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:39.130
Norman Reedus spent a lot of time talking
about Season 5 Daryl.

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:46.640
And for me at least in season 4, he was one
of the more interesting people on the show.

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:53.830
He said that he’s going to be much more
feral this year.

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:58.010
As in feral cat, with a large weapon.

00:06:58.010 --> 00:07:06.220
It’s really interesting to see how his character
has changed from season 1 to now.

00:07:06.220 --> 00:07:15.889
I feel like Rick has re-taken the leadership
role but it almost felt like farmer rick meant

00:07:15.889 --> 00:07:18.810
Daryl was going to step up and be the new
prison leader.

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:20.350
Even though technically they had the council.

00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:25.410
When we first met him and Meryl in season
1 he was so much more of an outsider.

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:30.669
That whole beth two part episode filled in
a lot of his childhood too.

00:07:30.669 --> 00:07:35.070
He had a pretty shitty upbringing, an like
a lot of children of abuse, he didn’t turn

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:37.920
into the happiest most social of creatures.

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:43.030
In a way, the apocalypse has been really good
to him.

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:47.270
In order to survive he’s had to learn to
be around and trust people.

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:50.900
He still shrugs his way through conversations,
but I really do think he feels like Rick’s

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:51.900
brother.

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:54.889
I think he totally believed it when he and
Rick were talking the morning after the big

00:07:54.889 --> 00:07:57.800
WTF Claimers scene.

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:02.199
Rick hasn’t replaced Meryl, but Daryl is
just open to the idea of the survivors as

00:08:02.199 --> 00:08:03.470
his family and friends.

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:07.870
He’s not the Navel gazing grumpy person
from season 1, I think watching him learn

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:10.790
to become a normal human has been half the
fun of the character.

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.510
The Crossbow really does it for me too.

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.181
The crossbow is where a lot of the fun is.

00:08:14.181 --> 00:08:18.560
Season 5 is obviously a bit of a dog fight
in terms of the first half of the season.

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:26.400
I had thought they’d wait till season 6
to do the Road to Washington DC, but it seems

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.650
like based on production images, shit will
go down at Terminus very very fast.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:32.810
So Daryl’s arc in season 5 isn’t going
to be so much about integrating with the group,

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:34.610
it will be more like Rick’s.

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.680
A lot of ass kicking for about 8 episodes.

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:42.159
I think when he lost Beth he kind of stalled
out emotionally, had she not been taken he

00:08:42.159 --> 00:08:43.959
probably would have continued to open up.

00:08:43.959 --> 00:08:46.079
Maybe smiled a lot more.

00:08:46.079 --> 00:08:48.449
But remember what he looked like when the
Claimers found him.

00:08:48.449 --> 00:08:51.730
He was just slumped down in the middle of
the road in a pile of fail.

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:54.999
It was like he regressed completely.

00:08:54.999 --> 00:08:58.300
The whole shit show at terminus is going to
jump start him in a big way.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:01.290
Like Norman Reedus said, you stick him in
a train car, he’s going to turn in to a

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:02.499
feral cat.

00:09:02.499 --> 00:09:03.860
What happens when you open the door.

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:08.930
He jumps out claws first.

00:09:08.930 --> 00:09:16.230
The thing I’m most looking forward to from
Daryl in Season 5 is the reunion with Beth.

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:17.230
Which probably won’t happen for a long time.

00:09:17.230 --> 00:09:20.660
I feel like once he finds beth again he’ll
get some closure on season 4 and he’ll be

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:30.760
able to start becoming a better human being
again.

00:09:30.760 --> 00:09:35.329
But let me know in the comments, what are
you most excited to see Daryl do in season

00:09:35.329 --> 00:09:36.329
5.

00:09:36.329 --> 00:09:38.269
Besides kill a lot of people with the crossbow?

00:09:38.269 --> 00:09:41.949
I probably won’t do a Q&amp;A video for this
just because of Korra and Doctor Who this

00:09:41.949 --> 00:09:46.089
weekend, but now that we’re getting closer
to the premiere I’m going to start doing

00:09:46.089 --> 00:09:47.089
more bonus videos.

00:09:47.089 --> 00:09:50.670
So feel free to leave me suggestions for things
you guys want to talk about.

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:52.856
My next bonus video will probably post next
Friday and I’ll probably do another character

00:09:52.856 --> 00:09:57.369
video be sure to subscribe to get it, maybe
for Carl or Rick or maybe Michonne.

00:09:57.369 --> 00:09:59.339
I’ll get to them all eventually.

00:09:59.339 --> 00:10:03.829
right now click here for my breakdown of the
season 5 trailer and click here to learn about

00:10:03.829 --> 00:10:05.220
some of the new characters this season.

00:10:05.220 --> 00:10:06.690
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:07.110
High Fives!

